82
00:15:09,829 --> 00:15:10,830
Apa?

83
00:15:11,331 --> 00:15:14,918
Sebentar lagi tengah malam
dan itu berarti hari akan berganti.

84
00:15:15,710 --> 00:15:19,047
<i>Mendiang hanya punya tiga hari lagi.</i>

85
00:15:20,715 --> 00:15:22,592
Waktuku tak banyak.

86
00:15:25,011 --> 00:15:26,179
Kenapa, ada apa?

87
