121
00:17:43,608 --> 00:17:44,609
Ya.

122
00:17:46,236 --> 00:17:49,030
Kau tak tampak cukup tua
untuk punya putri di SMA.

123
00:17:50,615 --> 00:17:51,867
Di bidang kerjaku,

124
00:17:51,950 --> 00:17:54,578
