219
00:33:47,864 --> 00:33:49,783
Bu, apa yang kau lakukan di sini?

220
00:33:50,575 --> 00:33:51,576
Apa?

221
00:33:52,619 --> 00:33:53,828
Kau bisa melihatku?

222
00:33:54,955 --> 00:33:55,956
Ya.

223
00:33:56,039 --> 00:33:57,040
Apa kau sudah mati?

224
00:33:58,208 --> 00:34:01,837
Tidak. Namun, aku hampir mati.

225
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:04,756
Astaga, kau sangat aneh.

226
